Month = {MAY 1},
Abstract = {We present and study the concept of m-periodic Gorenstein objects
   relative to a pair (A, 13) of classes of objects in an abelian category,
   as a generalization of m-strongly Gorenstein projective modules over
   associative rings. We prove several properties when (A, 13) satisfies
   certain homological condi-tions, like for instance when (A, 13) is a
   GP-admissible pair. Connections to Gorenstein objects and Gorenstein
   homologi-cal dimensions relative to these pairs are also established.(c)
